    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Pull lost warmth from dead relics.</em></p><p>When you <strong>salvage</strong> a destroyed construct, relic, vehicle, or large device during or immediately after a scene, you can stabilize the ghost of its purpose.</p><ul><li>Once per <strong>scene</strong>, when you successfully salvage from such a wreck (at the GM’s discretion that this is a meaningful recovery and not just scooping screws), your Domain gains <strong>+10 Economy marks</strong> for the next turn.</li><li>This doesn’t stack from multiple wrecks in the same scene; think of it as one big reclamation per incident.</li></ul>",
